WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.362
Hi! I'm Júlia. Today is a family party. Meet my family!

2
00:00:05.812 --> 00:00:10.549
Today is my grandmother's birthday. Her name is Rosa, and she's eighty!

3
00:00:10.999 --> 00:00:12.856
We're all at her house for lunch.

4
00:00:15.106 --> 00:00:20.958
My grandparents, Rosa and Antônio, have three children: my mother and my two uncles.

5
00:00:21.408 --> 00:00:26.609
And they have six grandchildren: me, my brother and my four cousins.

6
00:00:28.859 --> 00:00:32.017
This is my husband, Marcos. We live in São Paulo.

7
00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:34.696
He's a doctor, and he's very nice.

8
00:00:36.946 --> 00:00:40.940
And this is my mother, Teresa. She's Marcos's mother-in-law.

9
00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:44.687
Marcos is her son-in-law. They're good friends!

10
00:00:46.937 --> 00:00:52.788
And these are our children, Theo and Lili. Theo is six, and Lili is four.

11
00:00:53.238 --> 00:00:54.864
They love the birthday cake!

12
00:00:57.114 --> 00:00:59.714
And you? Tell me about your family!

